 "ref_ja": {
  "The courier asked me to deliver this for him. It's going to Gennosuke, in Sannocho.": "飛脚から頼まれた荷物だ。\n山王町の源之助まで届けよう。",
  "The courier asked me to deliver this for him. It's going to Kimi, in Umekojicho.": "飛脚から頼まれた荷物だ。\n梅小路町のキミまで届けよう。",
  "The courier asked me to deliver this for him. It's going to Yoshiko, in Umekojicho.": "飛脚から頼まれた荷物だ。\n梅小路町のヨシ子まで届けよう。",
  "The courier asked me to deliver this for him. It's going to Hatsutaro, in Umekojicho.": "飛脚から頼まれた荷物だ。\n梅小路町の初太郎まで届けよう。",
  "The courier asked me to deliver this for him. It's going to Gennosuke, in Umekojicho.": "飛脚から頼まれた荷物だ。\n梅小路町の源之助まで届けよう。",
  "The courier asked me to deliver this for him. It's going to Yakichi, in North Umekojicho.": "飛脚から頼まれた荷物だ。\n梅小路町北の弥吉まで届けよう。",
  "The courier asked me to deliver this for him. It's going to Tae, in Kawaramachi.": "飛脚から頼まれた荷物だ。\n河原町の妙まで届けよう。",
  "The courier asked me to deliver this for him. It's going to Tsuguemon, in Kawaramachi.": "飛脚から頼まれた荷物だ。\n河原町の継右衛門まで届けよう。",
  "The courier asked me to deliver this for him. It's going to Hana, in Kawaramachi.": "飛脚から頼まれた荷物だ。\n河原町の華まで届けよう。",
  "The courier asked me to deliver this for him. It's going to Yunosuke, in Kawaramachi.": "飛脚から頼まれた荷物だ。\n河原町の雄之助まで届けよう。",
  "The courier asked me to deliver this for him. It's going to Kyuzo, by the Mukurogai riverside.": "飛脚から頼まれた荷物だ。\n骸街川辺の九蔵まで届けよう。",
  "The courier asked me to deliver this for him. It's going to Dansaburo, by the Mukurogai riverside.": "飛脚から頼まれた荷物だ。\n骸街川辺の団三郎まで届けよう。",
  "The courier asked me to deliver this for him. It's going to Sadakichi, by the Mukurogai riverside.": "飛脚から頼まれた荷物だ。\n骸街川辺の定吉まで届けよう。",
  "The courier asked me to deliver this for him. It's going to Kyuzo, on the upper level of Mukurogai.": "飛脚から頼まれた荷物だ。\n骸街２階の九蔵まで届けよう。",
  "The courier asked me to deliver this for him. It's going to Dansaburo, on the upper level of Mukurogai.": "飛脚から頼まれた荷物だ。\n骸街２階の団三郎まで届けよう。",
  "The courier asked me to deliver this for him. It's going to Sadakichi, on the upper level of Mukurogai.": "飛脚から頼まれた荷物だ。\n骸街２階の定吉まで届けよう。",
  "Cooked insects, what's the big deal? Flavor aside, it's very nutritious.": "食べられる虫を焼いたものだそうだ。\n味はともかく、栄養はありそうだ。",
  "A simple meal of tea poured over rice. Great when you're short on time.": "飯に茶を注いだ、簡単な食事だ。\n時間が無い時などに重宝する。",
  "A collection of the day's leftover alcohol. As such, the taste is always a little different every time.": "飲み残しを集めた酒だそうだ。\n味は日によって変わる。",
  "A vegetable with a strong aroma. Great when boiled but also makes a wonderful garnish when thinly sliced.": "香りの強い野菜だ。煮てもいいし、\n薄切りを料理に乗せると良い香りを楽しめる。",
  "The fish is seared right in front of you so that you may experience the scent, freshness, and flavor.": "香りをもっとも楽しんでいただくために、\nお客様の目の前で炙ります。\n鮮度と美味しさをご堪能ください。",
  "Steamed bun kneaded with mugwort. It's not only fragrant, but good for your health.": "香り高いよもぎを練り込んだ饅頭だ。\n香草の香りが楽しめるだけでなく\n栄養にもいいという。",
  "A powerful greatsword said to cut clean through cavalrymen and their mounts as well.": "騎馬兵を馬ごと真っ二つにする\nという強力な大剣。",
  "These are bones. Of what, I can only wonder.": "骨だ。\nいったい何の骨なんだろう。",
  "Manju supposedly made by a renowned monk. Greatly increases Virtue.": "高名な僧が作ったという饅頭だ。\n大きな徳を得る事が出来るらしい。",
  "A katana meant for a noble scion. Tempering will likely empower the strength of one's allies.": "高貴な身分の者に献上できそうな刀で\n鍛えれば仲間の力を高めそうだ。",
  "A kanabo mace that can break any warrior's guard. Even oni are said to flee from its ferocious power.": "鬼ですら逃げ出すほどの圧倒的な\n威力ですべてを打ち砕く金棒。",
  "A knife once used for butchering bluefin, reforged into a blade fit for combat.": "鮪などの大きな魚を捌くための包丁を\n刀として使えるように打ち直した一本。",
  "A cannon which shoots oddly shaped shells that look like pigeons. Their irregular shape shortens their range.": "鳩のような奇妙な砲弾を発射する大筒。\n砲弾の形がいびつなので飛距離が短い。",
  "A chicken egg. Nutritious and useful in many different dishes.": "鶏の卵だ。\n栄養があって、色々な料理に使える。",
  "Raw egg dropped in a bowl of udon. The yolk looks like a full moon, and the flavor is mellow.": "鶏の生卵を落としたうどんだ。\nつゆに浮かぶ卵が月の様で美しく、\nうどんの味をまろやかにしてくれる。",
  "A snack made by mixing roasted and ground wheat flour with sugar, kneading it with water, then baking it. Known for its unique, savory flavor.": "麦を炒ってから挽いた粉に、\n砂糖などを混ぜて水でこねて焼いた菓子です。\n独特の香ばしさがあります。",
  "Sticks used for mahjong points. You currently have {s_value}.": "麻雀という娯楽で使う点棒。\n所持点 {s_value}",
  "A mysterious yellow dango. Moderately increases experience points in the Gunman style.": "黄色い色をした不思議な団子だ。\n短銃の型の経験値がそこそこ上昇する。",
  "A mysterious yellow daifuku. Greatly increases experience points in the Gunman style.": "黄色い色をした不思議な大福だ。\n短銃の型の経験値が大きく上昇する。",
  "A beautiful yellow liquid. Slightly increases experience points in the Gunman style.": "黄色い色をした綺麗な液体だ。\n短銃の型の経験値が少し上昇する。",
  "A brilliant golden sword which draws out and enhances its wielder's abilities.": "黄金で彩られた輝かしい一振り。\n使い手の能力を引き出してくれる。",
  "A cannon which fires at long distances and high speeds, just like those outfitted on the Black Ships.": "黒船に搭載されているものと同型の\n飛距離が長く弾速の速い大砲。",
  "A pistol resembling a dragon. While unstable, it can shoot multiple bullets at once with a high rate of fire.": "龍の形を模した拳銃。不安定ながら\n銃弾の同時発射と高い連射性能を誇る。",
  "A spear with dragon decorations. Its beauty will surely raise the morale of one's allies.": "龍の装飾を施した槍。\nその美しさは仲間の士気も高める。",
  "Exchange 1 ryo for 100 points.": "１両を賭け点１００点に\n交換します。",
  "Cash in 1,000 Pts.": "１千点を換金",
  "Cash in 10,000 Pts.": "１萬点を換金",
  "Exchange 1,000 mon for 10 points.": "１０００文を賭け点１０点に\n交換します。",
  "Dozens of fresh ingredients delicately placed atop a generous rice bowl. Accept no imitations.": "１２種類の新鮮のねたを豪華に盛り付けた\n他には真似できない贅沢な丼です。",
  "Three-flavored dango. It's made from rice, so it's quite filling.": "３種類の味が楽しめる団子だ。\n米から作られるので腹持ちもいい。",
  "A sword suited for artists. Legends speak of it slaying thirty-six men at a time.": "３６名の無頼の者を切り捨てても切れ味が\n衰えなかったと伝わる名刀。",
  "The Dragon of Dojima Skin": "<デジタルデラックス限定>龍馬スキン「堂島の龍」",
